msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If the <application>PyGObject3</application> module is not installed, you'd "
"have to skip the command making the build system use the LFS "
"<application>Setuptools</application> installation and then an Internet "
"connection would be needed.  The other packages are recommended because if "
"they're not installed, the build process will compile and link against its "
"own (often older)  version."
msgstr ""
"Se o módulo <application>PyGObject3</application> não estiver instalado, "
"você teria que ignorar o comando que faz o sistema de construção usar a "
"instalação do <application>Setuptools</application> do LFS e, então, uma "
"conexão com a Internet seria necessária. Os outros pacotes são recomendados "
"porque, se eles não estiverem instalados, o processo de construção compilará"
" e lincará à própria versão dele (geralmente mais antiga)."

#.   libdnet is not recommended, see:
#.       http://nmap.org/svn/libdnet-stripped/NMAP_MODIFICATIONS
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"liblinear\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpcap\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libssh2\"/>, <xref linkend=\"lua\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"pygobject3\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"liblinear\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpcap\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libssh2\"/>, <xref linkend=\"lua\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"pygobject3\"/>"

